r_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[4392,221229,553929,2436848,4167484],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"BLG夺得2026全球总决赛冠军，Knight就此集齐先锋赛、MSI与世界赛三项国际大赛冠军，成为LPL赛区继Meiko之后又一位满贯选手。 Knight此前已随TES、JDG、BLG三支战队多次夺得LPL联赛冠军，2023年随JDG拿下MSI冠军，2026年还随BLG夺得全球先锋赛冠军。Meiko于2021年随EDG夺得S赛冠军后完成满贯。"},"attached_info":"CkoIiMy8k7ao5/9MEAMaCTEyMTk2NzM1MCDh9+PXBjAAOIUDQAFyEzIxMDUyMTQ3MzE1NzMwOTY1OTZ4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"2235 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-beaa7f73796aadcbe5544159228707bd.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"2_1794731594.862323","card_id":"Q_2103430981067846812","target":{"id":2103430981067846812,"title":"如何看待王传君谈《爱情公寓》言论争议，称当年脑子里只有「关我屁事」和「关你屁事」，现在为冲动买单？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/2103430981067846812","type":"question","created":1794277025,"answer_count":172,"follower_count":415,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[5419,8412,9037,41538,221537],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"11月9日，《陈鲁豫・慢谈》最新一期上线，嘉宾王传君在长访谈中正面回应多年前因批评《爱情公寓》引发的争议。 节目中，鲁豫问他回头看当年演“关谷神奇”这个角色“算不算完成任务”，王传君干脆回答“完成了”。当被问及以今天的处事方式，是否还会像当年那样表达时，他直言：“当年我脑子里只有 ‘关我屁事’和‘关你屁事’这两句话。特别不接受任何人的绑架，你算什么？” 同时他也承认代价 ——“漫漫长路，在未来的时刻就要为那些冲动买单，现在得活得小心翼翼一点。” 2018 年，王传君曾公开称《爱情公寓》“越看越像一部广告片”，直言关谷神奇这个角色“跟傻子一样”，并拒绝出演电影版和第五季，面对网友追问回怼“关我屁事”，引发巨大争议。 来源：正在新闻 举报/反馈 王传君再谈《爱情公寓》言论争议：当年不接受任何人绑架，“未来的时刻要为冲动买单”"},"attached_info":"CkoIiMy8k7ao5/9MEAMaCTEyMTkxNzI0NSCh/cnXBjAAOJ8DQAJyEzIxMDM0MzA5ODEwNjc4NDY4MTJ4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"992 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-fccac856901852e7963104cc923c6f89.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"3_1794731594.863170","card_id":"Q_2104510599564636472","card_label":{"type":"hot","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-266e83dbee46dce23b718e0531cb7d3a_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-c89199839c237b87e52f010bb5e7d773_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":2104510599564636472,"title":"男子失业后断供房贷靠跑外卖维生，法院判决非恶意断供，涉案房系唯一住所暂不拍卖房产，如何从法律角度解读？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/2104510599564636472","type":"question","created":1794534426,"answer_count":160,"follower_count":447,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[215,1774,105508,153607,1927730],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"房贷断供，就是刻意欠债、规避履行？不一定。司法实践中，不少断供案件背后并非主观“失信”，而是生活变故导致的暂时履约“失能”。一边是银行不良贷款清收的刚性时限，一边是普通家庭唯一住房的存续希望。房产是否拍卖、纠纷能否和解？ 近日，成都市金牛区法院发布一起典型案件，男子莫某失业后跑外卖维持生计，断供房贷，是拍卖房产还款，还是再给这个家一个履约的机会？最终法院这样处理：莫某一次性履行欠付利息，其余部分分期还款；银行暂不处置房屋，继续查封房屋但解除其他强制措施。https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JWj-2oEBN5FcC-Xtj-YFBw"},"attached_info":"CkoIiMy8k7ao5/9MEAMaCTEyMTk0ODExOSCa2NnXBjAAOL8DQANyEzIxMDQ1MTA1OTk1NjQ2MzY0NzJ4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"677 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ef2f708efdc7ba9db3c1462d81e70683.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"4_1794731594.863754","card_id":"Q_2105209509492822064","card_label":{"type":"hot","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-266e83dbee46dce23b718e0531cb7d3a_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-c89199839c237b87e52f010bb5e7d773_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":2105209509492822064,"title":"GEN 总决赛不敌 BLG 止步亚军，这场比赛他们输在哪？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/2105209509492822064","type":"question","created":1794701059,"answer_count":51,"follower_count":61,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[18427,221229,40176