斯国防部此前还曾声称，10月29日击落1214架无人机。 俄罗斯官方及相关监测频道报告称，袭击造成人员伤亡，多处工业设施发生火灾。 俄罗斯伏尔加格勒州州长安德烈·博恰罗夫表示，该市一处工业区遭到袭击，造成4名工人死亡、2人受伤。相关监测频道报道称，俄罗斯伏尔加格勒炼油厂遭到袭击。该炼油厂是俄罗斯规模最大的炼油厂之一。 乌克兰监测频道Exilenova+还报告称，萨马拉州一处石油泵送和储存设施遭到袭击。该设施是俄罗斯石油管道运输体系的重要枢纽，承担原油接收、储存和运输等功能。网络流传的当地图片显示，设施附近发生大火，但袭击造成的实际损失尚未得到独立核实。 莫斯科市长谢尔盖·索比亚宁声称，有467架无人机飞向莫斯科地区，其中144架在接近莫斯科时被拦截。"},"attached_info":"CkoIiMy8k7ao5/9MEAMaCTEyMTk2MzUwNiCFy+DXBjAAONwCQAtyEzIxMDQ5ODQ1NjgyOTM4NDg2ODN4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"164 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/80/v2-d094f29ee3157192593b22afc7eaa182_1440w.webp?source=1def8aca"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"12_1794731594.867656","card_id":"Q_2103555144390653684","target":{"id":2103555144390653684,"title":"Windows系统相比macOS系统，真的卡的要死，Windows明知它的致命短板，为何一直都不解决？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/2103555144390653684","type":"question","created":1794306628,"answer_count":65,"follower_count":109,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[824],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkkIiMy8k7ao5/9MEAMaCTEyMTkyMzU0NSDE5MvXBjAAOG1ADHITMjEwMzU1NTE0NDM5MDY1MzY4NHgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"160 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e25dc8d7a8b72c3e62314e00114d5bb5.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"13_1794731594.867922","card_id":"Q_2104936968568190204","target":{"id":2104936968568190204,"title":"怎么看崔添翼在DeepSeek发布全家桶 API 后说，下一个超级 App 只属于个人的超级 App？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/2104936968568190204","type":"question","created":1794636081,"answer_count":24,"follower_count":90,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic